## 15. Recommendation

### 15.1 Overall Assessment: **{{ recommendation }}**

{% if recommendation == "Go" %}
The {{ site.site_name }} solar hybrid mini-grid project is **recommended to proceed** to full feasibility study and detailed engineering design.

**Basis for recommendation:**
- Project IRR of {{ (financial.project_irr * 100) | num(1) }}% exceeds the 8% threshold under base-case assumptions
- Subsidy requirement of {{ financial.subsidy_pct_capex }}% of CAPEX is within acceptable range (≤50%)
